K_POINTS
0
Gamma
4 4 4 0 0 0
// Format: Nx Ny Nz  shift_x shift_y shift_z
// shift 0 0 0 = Gamma-centered Monkhorst-Pack grid
// shift 1 1 1 = offset grid (may avoid Gamma point)
//
// Convergence notes:
//   - Insulators/semiconductors: 4x4x4 usually sufficient
//   - Metals: 8x8x8 or finer recommended
//   - Large supercells: 1x1x1 (Gamma-only) often adequate
